div(id="service_alerts_content" class=" w-full max-w-screen-sm lg:max-w-full mx-auto p-0 mb-6 lg:mb-0")
  h2(class="py-4 text-black text-2xl m-0")
    i(class="inline-block bi bi-bell-fill mr-2" aria-hidden="true")
    span(class="inline-block")="Service Alert Listing"

  div(class="timetable-alerts")
    //- Route selector - clickable swatches for affected routes
    nav#alerts-route-selector(aria-label="Filter alerts by route" class="mb-6")
      p#alerts-loading-message(class="text-gray-600") Checking for service alerts...
      div#alerts-route-list(class="flex flex-wrap gap-3" role="tablist" aria-label="Routes with active alerts")
      
    //- Target container for displaying alerts for selected route
    div#alerts-display-container(role="tabpanel" aria-live="polite" class="min-h-24")
      p#alerts-select-prompt(class="text-gray-600 hidden") Select a route above to view its alerts.